{"ID":"20240506110124-k5e1caf","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506110124-k5e1caf","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506110124-k5e1caf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240704113517-n8u0u3w\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614110151-ntc9dcw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1800\u0026#125;","title":"365补08饴糖（麦芽糖）","type":"doc","updated":"20240828135524"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240704113517-n8u0u3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704113517-n8u0u3w","updated":"20240828135428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 373px;","style":"width: 363px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"麦芽糖2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/麦芽糖2-20240704113516-nypkkm4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 363px;\" parent-style=\"width: 373px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704113553-pt546pn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704113553-pt546pn","updated":"20240828135429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 677px;","style":"width: 667px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"麦芽糖3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/麦芽糖3-20240704113553-okkvl28.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 667px;\" parent-style=\"width: 677px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 511px;","style":"width: 501px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"麦芽糖"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/麦芽糖-20240704113450-jwgz4k6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 501px;\" parent-style=\"width: 511px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704115843-sveb8jr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704115843-sveb8jr","updated":"20240828135524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 595px;","style":"width: 585px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦发芽"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦发芽-20240704115843-7zhulmf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 585px;\" parent-style=\"width: 595px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 596px;","style":"width: 586px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦发芽"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦发芽-20240828135524-1ba4y0m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 586px;\" parent-style=\"width: 596px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828135632-qencq4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828135632-qencq4h","updated":"20240828135632"}},{"ID":"20240614110453-gb20oe5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110453-gb20oe5","updated":"20240704113952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：以下为麦芽糖制作方法（仅供参考）"}]},{"ID":"20240704114007-7jgc61w","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240704114007-7jgc61w","updated":"20240704114007"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240704114007-ei8vzpq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240704114007-ei8vzpq","updated":"20240704114007"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240704114007-gxfh9yw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704114007-gxfh9yw","updated":"20240704114007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark strong","TextMarkTextContent":"准备材料"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：首先需要准备小麦和糯米作为主要原料。小麦需要提前浸泡并让其发芽，而糯米也需要提前浸泡以便更容易煮熟。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240704114007-dku73lz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240704114007-dku73lz","updated":"20240704114007"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240704114007-qy56yjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704114007-qy56yjg","updated":"20240704114007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发芽"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：将小麦浸泡后放在适当的环境中让其发芽，通常需要几天时间，具体时间取决于温度和湿度条件。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240704114007-ertg5d2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20240704114007-ertg5d2","updated":"20240704114007"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240704114007-2j1nzdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704114007-2j1nzdm","updated":"20240704114007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark strong","TextMarkTextContent":"处理糯米"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：将糯米浸泡后蒸熟或煮熟，以便更容易与麦芽混合并进行糖化反应。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240704114007-yitymou","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20240704114007-yitymou","updated":"20240704114007"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240704114007-3uezlao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704114007-3uezlao","updated":"20240704114007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark strong","TextMarkTextContent":"混合与发酵"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：将发芽的小麦切碎或搅碎，然后与煮熟的糯米混合，加入适量的水后放在温暖的地方进行发酵。这一步是利用小麦中的酶将糯米的淀粉转化为糖。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240704114007-i5w8ywh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20240704114007-i5w8ywh","updated":"20240704114007"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240704114007-mb95st2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704114007-mb95st2","updated":"20240704114007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark strong","TextMarkTextContent":"过滤与熬煮"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：发酵完成后，使用纱布或其他过滤材料将混合物中的固体滤去，留下糖水。然后将糖水倒入锅中熬煮，期间需要不断搅拌以防粘底，直到糖水变得浓稠，可以挂在搅拌铲上或形成一定的形状。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240704114007-hk83nlj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20240704114007-hk83nlj","updated":"20240704114007"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240704114007-zuge4u2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704114007-zuge4u2","updated":"20240704114007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark strong","TextMarkTextContent":"储存"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：熬煮好的麦芽糖可以倒入消毒过的玻璃瓶或其他容器中，密封保存。在阴凉干燥处可以保存一段时间。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240828135937-etfk1wg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828135937-etfk1wg","updated":"20240828140029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240506112358-efjylp7","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"383补26小麦（浮小麦）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110453-j65z2i5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110453-j65z2i5"}},{"ID":"20240614110525-a6a0pez","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110525-a6a0pez","updated":"20240614110603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110525-n1db68l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110525-n1db68l","updated":"20240614110556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即糃是也，多食动脾风。今医家用以和药，糯与粟米作者佳，余不堪用。蜀黍米亦可造。不思食人少食之，亦使脾胃气和。唐白乐天诗一楪胶牙糃者是此。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110453-r0ktoly","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110453-r0ktoly"}},{"ID":"20240614110515-jbzwbpg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110515-jbzwbpg","updated":"20240614110520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110515-fsqrym6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110515-fsqrym6","updated":"20240614110515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘温．入手足太阴阳明经．功专补中益气．健脾化痰．润肺止嗽．中满吐逆．酒病牙疳咸忌．肾病尤不可服．误吞稻芒．频食饴即愈．按用之建中．得桂枝为良．"}]},{"ID":"20240614110453-23i1kzt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110453-23i1kzt"}},{"ID":"20240614110504-flc6v58","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110504-flc6v58","updated":"20240614110508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110504-gl3dds9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110504-gl3dds9","updated":"20240614110504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缓中补虚．脾赖甘温而建立．养金治咳．肺承泽润以滋培．行瘀止衄必熬焦．化哽除痰宜噙化．（饴糖用糯米麦芽作成．味甘性温．缓中补虚．润肺止渴．是其所长．然多食助湿热．伤肾气．生虫损齿．每每有之．故凡物有利必有弊也．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110453-85do9ah","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110453-85do9ah"}},{"ID":"20240614110455-ny2d2lk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110455-ny2d2lk","updated":"20240614110459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110455-pczcfcn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110455-pczcfcn","updated":"20240614110455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味甘温，缓中益气，润燥除痰，为建中内托专药。中满忌之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110147-9duev5y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110147-9duev5y"}},{"ID":"20240614110443-gq3o2kg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110443-gq3o2kg","updated":"20240614110447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110443-cw8mbdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110443-cw8mbdn","updated":"20240614110443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘，温。入足太阴经。补中益气，健脾化痰，润肺止嗽。治咽痛，止吐血。解附子、草乌头毒。中满、吐逆、牙疳及肾病者忌用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110147-yhmkhhq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110147-yhmkhhq"}},{"ID":"20240614110434-v0t2xou","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110434-v0t2xou","updated":"20240614110439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖《神农本草经读》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110434-3rjurrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110434-3rjurrf","updated":"20240614110434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘、大温，无毒。主补虚气，止渴，去血。（《别录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110147-5o8pmud","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110147-5o8pmud"}},{"ID":"20240614110425-zhl6fz5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110425-zhl6fz5","updated":"20240614110429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖《本草思辨录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110425-yysp6s6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110425-yysp6s6","updated":"20240614110425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"土爰稼穑作甘，饴糖乃稼穑精华中之精华。脾土位居中央，若虚乏而当建中，建中而不旁补脾之物有五，曰人参、曰大枣、曰粳米、曰甘草、曰饴糖，皆能治脾虚之腹痛，而皆有宜有不宜。虚而挟寒，则必君以驱寒之品，如大建中汤之以参饴协椒姜是也。寒在下焦不宜，如当归生姜羊肉汤、乌头桂枝汤之无此五物是也。附子粳米汤，治腹中寒气雷鸣切痛，胸胁逆满呕吐，何尝不是下焦之寒，何以有粳米甘草大枣，又何以无参饴？曰∶此无味不确切，须就其证细审之耳。寒在腹中而痛，实由下焦浊阴上泛，致胸胁逆满呕吐。附子所以温肾，半夏所以止呕，脾虚宜补，而有呕吐之虚，则中不宜滞，阴则宜益，米枣甘草，所以补虚而益阴。人参嫌其升气，饴嫌其滞中，故避之。小建中甘草用炙而此不炙，亦以其滞故也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110425-xch8phn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110425-xch8phn","updated":"20240614110425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胁邹氏谓桂枝加芍药汤主腹满痛，小建中汤主腹急痛，盖芍药酸而破阴，饴糖甘而缓急，此言是矣。然小建中治急痛，而芍药仍在者有故也。徐氏云，桂枝汤，外证得之为解肌、调营卫。内证得之为化气、和阴阳。桂姜协草枣，所以化阴。芍药协草枣，所以化阳。芍药不止治腹满，故小建中于虚劳里急悸衄等证皆主之。惟以治满痛，则于桂枝汤原方加一倍，而饴糖则摈之耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110425-ebifpr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110425-ebifpr4","updated":"20240614110425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"邹氏于建中大小之分，创为势合势分，力专力薄二说，而断之以君尊而臣从命，君卑而臣擅命。实则终无一当也。何以言之？小建中所治不一，而其扼要在建中。以云建中，犹建中之小者耳。若大建中则专治中藏虚寒，不兼顾他经之证。腹中寒句是主，余皆腹寒之所波及。周扬俊云∶中气虚则阳气不布，故所积者为寒饮，所冲者为寒气。尤在泾云∶阴凝成象，腹中虫物乘之而动。二说极当。温脾无过干姜，补脾无过人参胶饴。椒能由脾达肾，以消饮而杀虫，亦温脾之要药。此四物大温大补，不出中宫，建中有大于是者乎。观于大建中惟入腹满一门，小建中则分隶于伤寒论，与金匮之血痹黄瘅妇人杂病各门，仲圣制剂标名之意，更灼然可见。自来注家无论及此者，殊足怪也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110147-nygsbqn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110147-nygsbqn"}},{"ID":"20240614110413-cstt3ia","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110413-cstt3ia","updated":"20240614110417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110413-o0tj4t0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110413-o0tj4t0","updated":"20240614110413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘温，益气补中，缓脾润肺，化痰止嗽。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110147-i3rjsm8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110147-i3rjsm8"}},{"ID":"20240614110403-4a7vgah","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110403-4a7vgah","updated":"20240614110407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110403-2zygop8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110403-2zygop8","updated":"20240614110403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，微温。主补虚乏，止渴，去血。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110403-4a08aqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110403-4a08aqc","updated":"20240614110403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方家用饴糖，乃云胶饴，皆是湿糖如浓蜜者，建中汤多用之。其凝强及牵白者，不入药。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110403-inrjrt3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110403-inrjrt3","updated":"20240614110403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又今酒用曲，糖用 ，犹同是米、麦，而为中、上之异。糖当以和润为优，酒以熏乱为劣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110147-43nzstv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110147-43nzstv"}},{"ID":"20240614110354-4qsh772","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110354-4qsh772","updated":"20240614110357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖《要药分剂》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110354-7p5na4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110354-7p5na4e","updated":"20240614110354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘。性微温。无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110354-jh63od4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110354-jh63od4","updated":"20240614110354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主补虚乏。益气力。润五脏。消痰止嗽。（开宝）【归经】入肺脾二经。为滋润之品。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110354-wi50ko4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110354-wi50ko4","updated":"20240614110354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【前论】丹溪曰。饴属土。成于火。大发湿中之热。多食动脾风。能生胃火。此损齿之因。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110354-f588hc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110354-f588hc5","updated":"20240614110354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳌按、本草诸米皆可作饴。惟以糯米作者入药。以糯米能补益脏气也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110147-vgtm1e2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110147-vgtm1e2"}},{"ID":"20240614110345-oqyb2hz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110345-oqyb2hz","updated":"20240614110348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110345-tx3bkxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110345-tx3bkxy","updated":"20240614110345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖甘温补肺虚，止渴消痰咳自除，温胃进食更消瘀，胀呕湿热休含诸。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110345-o054tf4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110345-o054tf4","updated":"20240614110345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以糯米煮粥，候冷入麦芽，澄清者再熬如琥珀紫色。软者谓之胶饴，建中汤多用之。其牵白凝强者谓之饴糖，不入药用。诸米皆可作饴，惟糯米者佳。无毒，入足太阴经。补虚乏，润肺止渴，消痰止嗽，敛汗；又补中气，健脾胃，进饮食；去留血，止吐血，又打损瘀血，熬焦和酒服之，能下恶血∶骨鲠喉中及误吞钱环，服之便出。惟中满及呕吐忌之。丹溪云∶属土而成于火，大发湿中之热。《衍义》谓动脾风，是言其末也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110147-454qj6a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110147-454qj6a"}},{"ID":"20240614110336-tdl89nr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110336-tdl89nr","updated":"20240614110340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖《本草择要纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110336-12c1j79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110336-12c1j79","updated":"20240614110336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（释名饧音徐．糖之清者曰饴．稠者曰饧．色紫类琥珀者．方中谓之胶饴．干枯者名饧．方家用饴．乃云胶饴．是湿糖如浓蜜者．其宁结及牵白者饧糖不入药用．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110336-t1x8c9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110336-t1x8c9l","updated":"20240614110336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】"}]},{"ID":"20240614110336-t5e50r4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110336-t5e50r4","updated":"20240614110336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘大温无毒入太阴经．"}]},{"ID":"20240614110336-7oetpg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110336-7oetpg0","updated":"20240614110336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240614110336-89y9wgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110336-89y9wgn","updated":"20240614110336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"补虚乏．止渴去血．补虚冷．益气力．止肠鸣咽痛．治吐血．消痰润肺止嗽．健脾胃．补中．打损瘀血者熬焦酒服能下恶血．又伤寒大毒嗽．于蔓菁薤汁中煮一沸．顿服之良．脾弱不思食人．少用能和胃气．亦用和药．解附子草为头毒．古方建中汤多用之．糖与酒皆用米 ．而饴居上品．酒居中品．是糖以和润为优．酒以醺乱为劣．脾欲缓．急食甘以缓之．饴之甘以缓中也．饴乃脾经气分药也．甘能补脾之不足．"}]},{"ID":"20240614110147-xb2vdfi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110147-xb2vdfi"}},{"ID":"20240614110327-2bwpfg9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110327-2bwpfg9","updated":"20240614110330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110327-da76p1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110327-da76p1r","updated":"20240614110327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，微温．主补虚乏，止渴，去血．"}]},{"ID":"20240614110147-6ofd50l","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110147-6ofd50l"}},{"ID":"20240614110316-tnc4xfn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110316-tnc4xfn","updated":"20240614110321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110316-a61xyla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110316-a61xyla","updated":"20240614110316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"补中缓脾．"}]},{"ID":"20240614110316-wzqfwqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110316-wzqfwqu","updated":"20240614110316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘温．益气补中．健脾化痰．润肺止嗽．（仲景建中汤用之、取其甘以补脾缓中也．）过用能动火生痰．凡中满吐逆．酒病牙疳．咸忌之．肾病尤不可服．（误吞稻芒、频食饴、妙．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110147-ontu0cm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110147-ontu0cm"}},{"ID":"20240614110158-6j07pb1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110158-6j07pb1","updated":"20240614110236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110158-bgg37b6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110158-bgg37b6","updated":"20240614110158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药用】本品为以糯米或粳米磨成粉，煮熟，加入麦芽，搅合均匀，微火煎熬而成的饴。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110158-h416cgk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110158-h416cgk","updated":"20240614110158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】甘，微温。入脾、胃、肺经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110158-66l1m8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110158-66l1m8j","updated":"20240614110158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】补中缓痛，润肺止咳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110158-xrfgxyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110158-xrfgxyo","updated":"20240614110158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】1.用于中气虚乏，腹中急痛等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110158-o7ml64e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110158-o7ml64e","updated":"20240614110158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖甘润，功能补虚乏、建中气，治疗脾胃虚弱，可与党参、黄耆等药配合应用；本品还有缓急止痛作用，治疗虚寒性腹中急痛可与桂枝、芍药、甘草等配合应用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110158-l9xx6sc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110158-l9xx6sc","updated":"20240614110158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.用于肺虚咳嗽等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110158-q1ygeph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110158-q1ygeph","updated":"20240614110158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品甘润益肺，治肺虚咳嗽，常与沙参、百部、杏仁等配合应用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110158-q6wx80s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110158-q6wx80s","updated":"20240614110158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】饴糖"}]},{"ID":"20240614110158-gb6r58m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110158-gb6r58m","updated":"20240614110158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】一两至二两，冲服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110158-bhgg284","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110158-bhgg284","updated":"20240614110158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】小建中汤《伤寒论》：饴糖，桂枝、白芍、甘草、生姜，大枣。治脾胃虚寒引起的胃脘病，以及心悸、虚烦等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110158-514bv6v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110158-514bv6v","updated":"20240614110158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【文献摘录】《别录》：「补虚乏，止渴。」"}]},{"ID":"20240614110158-u07i0qg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110158-u07i0qg","updated":"20240614110158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《千金要方》：「补虚冷，益气力，止肠鸣，咽痛....消痰润肺止嗽。」"}]},{"ID":"20240614110147-qg7y8r5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110147-qg7y8r5"}},{"ID":"20240614110148-enum6n2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-enum6n2","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：饴糖"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-145k9a7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-145k9a7","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-76r5np0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-76r5np0","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Yí Tánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-7i3z9io","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-7i3z9io","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-lsnitmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-lsnitmy","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 麦芽糖"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-trhph3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-trhph3d","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-osheu5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-osheu5x","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 加工品。将米或其他淀粉物质，经过浸渍蒸熟后，加入麦芽，使其发酵，再加水煎熬，溶出所有糖分，滤除渣质，浓缩，即成"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"饴糖"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-gc1wenb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-gc1wenb","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品有软硬之分，药用以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"软饴糖"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-vredrft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-vredrft","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-p3udkk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-p3udkk9","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全国各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-wgctdrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-wgctdrf","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-l7oac5a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-l7oac5a","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 补中益气，健脾和胃，润肺止咳。主治脾胃虚弱，干性咳嗽，肺燥咳嗽。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-fcyfqzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-fcyfqzp","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-gtazz62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-gtazz62","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1～2两。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-0as0ran","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-0as0ran","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-m5mjl9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-m5mjl9s","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-mss0j7v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-mss0j7v","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：饴糖"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-2jdk45m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-2jdk45m","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-bnfhqdo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-bnfhqdo","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Yí Tánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-3zlwd6y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-3zlwd6y","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-8xf65qd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-8xf65qd","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 饧（《方言》），胶饴（陶弘景），饧糖（孟诜），软糖（《蜀本草》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-ijp883d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-ijp883d","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-7knqoyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-7knqoyu","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-ea84dt4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-ea84dt4","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-cmvllx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-cmvllx6","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为米、大麦、小麦、粟或玉蜀黍等粮食经发酵糖化制成的糖类食品。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-s9a204x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-s9a204x","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-58toinh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-58toinh","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 饴糖有软、硬之分，软者为黄褐色浓稠液体，粘性很大；硬者系软饴糖经搅拌，混入空气后凝固而成，为多孔之黄白色糖饼。味甘，药用以秋饴糖为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-d1cm9gq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-d1cm9gq","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-u3eflnw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-u3eflnw","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入脾、胃、肺经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-cty0a4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-cty0a4j","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《汤液本草》：\"入足太阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-emviufq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-emviufq","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入肺、脾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-vt32ecc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-vt32ecc","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草汇言》：\"入足阳明、太阴经气分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-m01gaiv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-m01gaiv","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-39q4sbg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-39q4sbg","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-lis7qqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-lis7qqg","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"味甘，微温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-818yqyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-818yqyd","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草蒙筌》：\"味甘苦。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-5jjxvma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-5jjxvma","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《纲目》：\"甘，大温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-6nlx5m5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-6nlx5m5","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-cob0j0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-cob0j0s","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 湿热内郁，中满吐逆忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-2vq0vpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-2vq0vpp","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《品汇精要》：\"中满不宜用，呕家勿用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-83q9ryb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-83q9ryb","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"秘结、牙露、赤目、疳病者，切宜忌之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-6ktytxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-6ktytxw","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-acr2hst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-acr2hst","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 缓中，补虚，生津，润燥。治劳倦伤脾，里急腹痛，肺燥咳嗽，吐血，口渴，咽痛，便秘。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-9m6jig5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-9m6jig5","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"主补虚乏，止渴，去血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-okromw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-okromw8","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《千金·食治》：\"补虚冷，益气力，止肠鸣、咽痛，除唾血，却咳嗽。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-dnklpyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-dnklpyz","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③孟诜：\"补虚止渴，健脾胃气，去留血，补中。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-lyathwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-lyathwa","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》：\"益气力，消痰止嗽，并润五脏。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-sqzmop1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-sqzmop1","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《圣惠方》：\"解乌头、天雄、附子毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-i3ti97t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-i3ti97t","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草蒙筌》：\"和脾，润肺，止渴，消痰。治喉骾鱼骨，疗误吞钱环。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-p59y8pi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-p59y8pi","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《本草汇言》：\"治中焦营气暴伤，眩晕，消渴，消中，怔忡烦乱。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-ll49baq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-ll49baq","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨《长沙药解》：\"补脾精，化胃气，生津，养血，缓里急，止腹痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-6uf3nlz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-6uf3nlz","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-bsujkdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-bsujkdc","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：烊化冲入汤药中，1～2两；熬膏或入丸剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-crytg3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-crytg3q","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-9ybaasq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-9ybaasq","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治虚劳里急，悸衄，腹中痛，梦失精，四肢酸疼，手足烦热，咽干口燥：桂枝三两（去皮），甘草三两（炙），大枣十二枚，芍药六两，生姜三两，胶饴一升。上六味，以水七升，煮取三升，去滓，内胶饴，更上微火消解，温服一升，日三服。（《金匮要略》小建中汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-onnpqga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-onnpqga","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治心胸中大寒痛，呕不能饮食，腹中寒，上冲皮起，出见有头足，上下痛而不可触近：蜀椒二合（炒，去汗），干姜四两，人参二两。上三味，以水四升，煮取二升，去滓，纳胶饴气升，微火煎取一升半，分温再服。（《金匮要略》大建中汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-eq9yvqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-eq9yvqi","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治卒得咳嗽：饴糖六两，干姜六两（末之），豉二两。先以水一升，煮豉三沸，去滓，纳饴糖，消，纳干姜，分为三服。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-tep288n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-tep288n","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治伤寒大毒嗽：怡糖于蔓菁、薤汁中煎一沸，顿服之。（《食疗本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-f3rxr5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-f3rxr5v","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治咸哮喘嗽：胶饴拌轻粉，熬焦为丸，噙化。（《本经逢原》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-ubigjlj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-ubigjlj","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治大人小儿顿咳不止：白萝卜捣汁一碗，饴糖五钱。蒸化，乘热缓缓呷之。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-w251p8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-w251p8i","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治大便干结不通：饴糖拈成指头大，用香油涂拌绿矾末，塞谷道内。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-z9mo9is","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-z9mo9is","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治胎坠不安：饴糖五钱，以砂仁泡汤化服。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-yjb8w6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-yjb8w6z","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治诸鱼骨哽在喉中：饴糖不拘多少，为丸如鸡子黄大，吞之，又渐作大丸，再吞。（《圣济总录》饴糖丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-yr6h6qz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-yr6h6qz","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治误吞银环及钗者：饴糖一斤，一顿渐渐食尽，多食之。（《古今录验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-wyss24o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-wyss24o","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治误吞稻芒：白饧频食。（《简便单方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-ebkcacb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-ebkcacb","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿服药过剂闷乱者：饴糖食之。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-wst6817","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-wst6817","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-b5ibfu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-b5ibfu5","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《注解伤寒论》：\"《内经》曰，脾欲缓，急食甘以缓之。胶饴、大枣、甘草之甘以缓中也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-sy4w4jr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-sy4w4jr","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"甘属土，肾病毋多食甘。甘伤肾，肾痛而齿落，皆指此类也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-bz24z7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-bz24z7r","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经疏》：\"饴糖，甘入脾，而米麦皆养脾胃之物，故主补虚乏，仲景建中汤用之是也。肺胃有火则发渴，火上炎，迫血妄行则吐血，甘能缓火之标，则火下降而渴自止，血自去也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-anfuatw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-anfuatw","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《药征续编》：\"胶饴之功，盖似甘草及蜜，故能缓诸急。考征小建中汤证曰腹中急痛，又曰里急，又曰妇人腹中痛。大建中汤证曰上下痛而不可触近。黄芪建中汤证曰里急。依此三方，则胶饴能治里急，夫腹中急痛，腹中痛，岂非里急矣乎。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-tcgkuek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-tcgkuek","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本经疏证》：\"人身一天地也，嘘故纳新，环周不休，气之道也；十二经脉，十五大络，血之道也。其资皆禀于脾，则虚乏者，不可谓非脾气不给矣。脾气不给，参、芪、术、草皆能资助之，此独何借于饴糖?夫《别录》补虚乏巳下，遂继之以止渴、去血。则芪、术者，皆与渴无干，且术能去湿，不能滋燥，芪能充外，不能充内，参、草能充内，且滋燥矣，又与血无干，以是见此虚此乏，断非参、芪、术、草所能补矣。虽然，虚乏而气不能行且渴者固多，又何以知有当去不去之血。夫仲景用饴糖，多在建中汤，建中汤证多有腹痛，此血当行不行之验也。是故饴糖非能去瘀血也，能治血当行不行为腹痛者耳。故《伤寒》、《金匮》用建中处甚多，然止云治腹痛，不云下瘀血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-5dg0z1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-5dg0z1o","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-lqhk3tb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-lqhk3tb","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-16ww5vb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-16ww5vb","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：饴糖"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-uq43myx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-uq43myx","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-uopkovr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-uopkovr","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Yí Tánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-su162ea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-su162ea","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-18ms4fv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-18ms4fv","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 饧、胶饴、软糖、饧糖、糖稀"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-s62ec33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-s62ec33","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-l7hzt77","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-l7hzt77","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Malt Sugar"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-jcw62sd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-jcw62sd","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-rn4106h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-rn4106h","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《本草经集注》。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-gvzvtbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-gvzvtbq","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.陶弘景：方家用饴糖，乃云胶饴，皆是湿糖如厚蜜者，建中汤中多用之。其凝强及牵白者不入药。今酒用曲，糖用蘖，犹同是米麦，而为中上之异，糖当以和润为优，酒以醺乱为劣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-vqlhcdw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-vqlhcdw","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《蜀本草》：《图经》云，饴即软糖也，北人谓之场。粳米、粟米、大麻、白术、黄精、枳椇子等，并堪作之，惟以糯米作者入药。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-u56aijz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-u56aijz","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草纲目》：按刘熙《释名》云，餹之清者曰饴，形怡怡然也；稠者曰饧，"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-hp9ebae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-hp9ebae","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-2gpw1yo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-2gpw1yo","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为用高梁、米、大麦、小麦、粟玉米等含淀粉质的粮食为原料，经发酵糖化制成的食品。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-0foe5me","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-0foe5me","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Saccharum Granorum,Saccharum Granorum, Glucidtemns"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-2whpine","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-2whpine","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-zkuc1cy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-zkuc1cy","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全国各地均产。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-p0dwpda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-p0dwpda","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-z6lmkhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-z6lmkhp","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 饴糖有软、硬之分，软者为黄褐色浓稠液体，粘性很大；硬者系软饴糖经搅拌，混入空气后凝固而成，为多孔之黄白色糖饼。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-w3b5xzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-w3b5xzt","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-wqsish8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-wqsish8","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味甘，药用以软饴精为佳。本品以浅黄、质粘稠、味甘无杂味，为上品，干硬名饧，不堪入药。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-yuqkumr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-yuqkumr","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-uygd8ua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-uygd8ua","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含麦芽糖89.5%，蛋白质、脂肪、维生素B2.维生素C及烟酸等。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-y2aedgt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-y2aedgt","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-8c1szr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-8c1szr1","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品具有麦芽糖的一般作用，临床观察有滋养、止咳、止腹绞痛作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-0n164eh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-0n164eh","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-0ycl2p9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-0ycl2p9","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品通常以糯米或粳米磨成粉，煮熟，加入麦芽，搅合均匀，微火煎熬而成。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-h9t8piu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-h9t8piu","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-q0xg42i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-q0xg42i","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 脾；胃；肺经"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-e52q4cy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-e52q4cy","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-hmv83eo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-hmv83eo","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘；温"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-2za9nvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-2za9nvc","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-mr1nj8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-mr1nj8t","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 湿热内郁，中满吐逆忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-xb0t78g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-xb0t78g","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-qe0x251","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-qe0x251","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 缓中；补虚；生津；润燥。主劳倦伤脾；里急腹痛；肺燥咳嗽；吐血；口渴；咽痛；便秘"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-nkaybdw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-nkaybdw","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-87k44hd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-87k44hd","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：烊化冲入汤药中，30-60g；熬膏或入丸剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-6osov04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-6osov04","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-mi8f759","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-mi8f759","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《注解伤寒论》：《内经》曰，脾欲缓，急食甘以缓之。胶饴、大枣、甘草之甘以缓中也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-l15qsy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-l15qsy3","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草纲目》：甘属土，肾病毋多食甘。甘伤肾，肾痛而齿落，皆指此类也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-x23q2iq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-x23q2iq","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草经疏》：饴糖，甘入脾，而米麦皆养脾胃之物，故主补虚乏，仲景建中汤用之是也。肺胃有火则发渴，火上炎，迫血妄行则吐血，甘能缓火之际，则火下降而渴自止，血自去也。4.《药征续编》：胶饴之功，盖似甘草及蜜，故能缓诸急。考征小建中汤证曰腹中急痛，又曰里急，又曰妇人腹中痛。大建中汤证曰上下痛而不可触近。黄芪建中汤证曰里急。依此三方，则胶饴能治里急，夫腹中急痛，腹中痛，岂非里急矣乎。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-y90xber","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-y90xber","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本经疏证》：人身一天地也，嘘故纳新，环周不休，气之道也；十二经脉、十五大络，血之道也。其资皆禀于脾，则虚乏者，不可谓非脾气不给矣。脾气不给，参、芪、术。草皆能资助之，此独何借于饴糖？夫《别录》补虚乏已下，遂继之以止渴、去血。则芪、术者，皆与渴无干，且术能去湿，不能滋燥，芪能充外，不能充内，参、草能充内，且滋燥矣，又与血无干，以是见此虚此乏，断非参、芪、术、草所能补矣。虽然，虚乏而气不能行且渴者固多，又何以知有当去不去之血。夫仲景用饴糖，多在建中汤，建中汤证多有腹痛，此血当行不行之验也。是故饴糖非能去瘀血也，能治血当行不行为腹痛者耳。故《伤寒》、《金匮》用建中处甚多，然止云治腹痛，不云下瘀血。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-h1igbj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-h1igbj2","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《名医别录》：主补虚乏，止渴，去血。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-2g7yk1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-2g7yk1u","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《千金·食治》：补虚冷，益气力，止肠鸣、咽痛，除唾血，却咳嗽。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-1f6hfv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-1f6hfv9","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.盂诜：补虚止渴，健脾胃气，去留血，补中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-cti8vh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-cti8vh6","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《日华子本草》：益气力，消痰止嗽，并润五脏。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-f6vo9k1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-f6vo9k1","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《圣惠方》：解乌头、天雄、附子毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-allh648","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-allh648","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《本草蒙筌》：和脾，润肺，止渴，消痰，治喉鲠鱼骨，疗误吞钱环。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-ezvkw60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-ezvkw60","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12.《本草汇言》：治中焦营气暴伤，眩晕，消渴，消中，怔忡烦乱。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-lunac9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-lunac9p","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13.《长沙药解》：补脾精，化胃气，生津，养血，缓里急，止腹痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-mt2nule","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-mt2nule","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614110148-ivi5a20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110148-ivi5a20","updated":"20240614110148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614110150-69bmrg9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614110150-69bmrg9"}},{"ID":"20240614110151-ntc9dcw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614110151-ntc9dcw"}}]}